{
  "$comment": "Allowlist for `npm run import:pyq`. A source may only be enabled if its licence permits reuse; the importer refuses anything without a declared licence. Questions are mapped onto TSBIE chapters with content/chapter-keywords.json, and anything that cannot be mapped confidently is skipped.",
